user prompt; Bedrock returns stopReason=content_filtered with only an empty reasoningContent block. pydantic-ai then sends call 2 with \"Validation feedback: Please return text.\" which is also content_filtered (0 output tokens); that second request is the one in the CI log (413 input tokens there, 245-302 locally). 4/4 runner runs of current/single_shot reproduced exactly this two-call sequence.\n\nPer-cell, through the rebar runner (_live_reply): current/agentic 2/3 filtered, current/single_shot 2/3, sentinel/agentic 0/3, sentinel/single_shot 0/3.\n\nOne-change-at-a-time, direct converse, 8 calls each: single_shot as shipped 8/8 filtered; without \"Return PASS.\" 8/8; agentic as shipped 6/8; agentic without \"so return PASS\" 3/8; no system prompt 0/8; no effort field 8/8; with sentinel directive 0/8; system \"You are a completion verifier.\" 7/8; system \"You emit a single structured verdict.\" 8/8; system \"You are a helpful assistant.\" 0/8; plus \"Respond with only the JSON object\" 8/8. Adding a concrete acceptance criterion + test/source evidence and keeping every other word (incl. Return PASS): single_shot 0/10, agentic 0/10.\n\nConclusion: the filter fires on a verifier asked for a verdict with nothing to verify. Not the reasoning-in-schema refusal (no schema is sent; text mode; no reasoning requested). The 2026-11-09 green run (872e7f6c3fd) predates 06b3b1a5230, so it ran on the 4.x ids; the trigger arrived with the 5.5 upgrade.\n\nProduction exposure: the real completion-verifier prompt (src/rebar/llm/reviewers/completion_verifier.md rendered via prompts.resolve_prompt_cached) with a ticket context that has an AC but no evidence: Opus 5.5 0/10, Sonnet 5.5 0/10; with no AC and no evidence: Opus 0/10, Sonnet 0/10. So the empty-evidence production path is not filtered in this measurement.\n\nReplacement prompts (evidence-bearing, as pinned in the plan) direct converse: 0/50 in each of the 4 (variant, prompt) cells = 0/200; through the runner 0/20 per variant.","timestamp":1794364363991642995},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"PRE-PUSH LIVE CHECK (2026-11-10 PST, session 3d705fec). Shipped prompts (sm.PROMPTS in commit 7a3baab7a2c, byte-identical to the probed text): direct converse on Bedrock Opus 5.5, 50 calls per (variant, prompt) cell: current/agentic 0/50, current/single_shot 0/50, sentinel/agentic 0/50, sentinel/single_shot 0/50 filtered (all end_turn). Through the rebar runner, 5 per cell: 0 filtered, 10/10 parsed per variant. Full live test locally (pytest -m \"external and llm_live\" tests/external/test_structured_output_matrix.py, bedrock overlay, 40 calls): test body passed; score table bedrock__current n=20 current_ok=20 new_ok=20 (fenced 20), bedrock__sentinel n=20 current_ok=20 new_ok=20 (prose 20). The run's only error was the teardown HEAD-moved guard, tripped because this session committed 7a3baab7a2c in the same worktree mid-run; it is not a test failure. Before the \"empty when every criterion is met\" clause the evidence prompts parsed 0/20 per variant (findings missing required `detail`). make verify is running on 7a3baab7a2c.","timestamp":1794365143625141685},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"LANDED + LIVE VERIFIED (2026-11-10 PST, session 3d705fec). Gerrit change 3344 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/3344) merged at LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, 0 unresolved; merge commit on main 9f8b2af21c8eff24ba85f9625fcc6d80f77d5742. make verify on the pushed commit exited 0 (20896 passed / 29 skipped default tier, 202 passed / 2 skipped integration tier). No config key, env var or feature flag added (test-only diff: tests/external/_structured_matrix.py, tests/external/test_structured_output_matrix.py, tests/unit/test_structured_matrix_scorer.py). Live External Integration dispatched on main at 9f8b2af21c8: run 42955953345 (https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/42955953345); job `external LLM (live bedrock)` (job 130310980316) concluded success at ~20:09 PST; the anthropic and openai arms also succeeded.","timestamp":1794370217924408045},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"HANDOFF STATE 2026-11-10 20:16 PST (session 3d705fec): CLOSED (class preexisting) through the completion-verifier gate from the fix-grackle worktree at 9f8b2af21c8. Root cause: the structured-output matrix asked Opus 5.5, under a completion-verifier system prompt, for a ticket verdict with no criterion or evidence; Bedrock content-filtered it (8/8 single-shot, 6/8 agentic). The defect was in the test prompts since they were written; the 5.5 upgrade (06b3b1a5230) is what exposed it. Fix: change 3344 (merge 9f8b2af21c8) gives both prompts a criterion and evidence; 0/200 filtered live. Live External Integration run 42955953345 on main: bedrock arm success. Production completion-verifier prompt measured unaffected (0/40 with no evidence). Nothing running; no pending decision. unkempt-amaranth-archerfish still needs its scheduled Sunday 2026-11-15 ~22:16 PST run to conclude success (other jobs, e.g. jira DC smoke, were still in progress on run 42955953345 at close time).","timestamp":1794370618429953104}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1794361354781575708,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"d57d6574-4ca6-4b1f-baf7-e55928762a99","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"32ae-e4ae-b908-4e42"},{"link_uuid":"47a8a1ec-e2a8-439e-805e-7b71a0147887","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"7341-7f22-b13a-442c"},{"link_uuid":"75e6f28a-f7bd-43a8-a5cf-576679bb56dc","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"4245-9f90-9d32-44c0"},{"link_uuid":"58f1cc36-cf4e-427e-b7e4-849ea3655a32","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"3062-d19f-9c00-4c81"},{"link_uuid":"17c0a411-a546-48fe-879a-39331e407495","provenance":"derived","relation":"caused_by","target_id":"a40f-25e4-885c-4cca"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe `external LLM (live bedrock)` job of the `Live External Integration` workflow failed on dispatch run 42939278248 (https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/42939278248, 2026-11-10 17:29 PST, main at 91182f96362). Its last green run, 42684304178 (2026-11-09, at 872e7f6c3fd), predates 06b3b1a5230 (Gerrit 3340), which moved `.github/llm-providers/bedrock.toml` to the 5.5 ids. Ticket unkempt-amaranth-archerfish needs the scheduled run (Sunday 2026-11-15 ~22:16 PST) green.\n\nFailure: `tests/external/test_structured_output_matrix.py::test_structured_output_matrix` raised `LLMInputRejectedError` wrapping pydantic-ai `ContentFilterError`: Bedrock `content_filtered`, 0 output tokens, `us.anthropic.claude-opus-5-5`.\n\n## Root cause\nMeasured live on Bedrock Opus 5.5 (us-east-1, effort high); full counts in the ROOT-CAUSE EVIDENCE comment on this ticket. The harness system prompt (\"You are a completion verifier that emits a single structured verdict.\") plus either matrix prompt asks for a ticket verdict with no criterion text and no evidence. Opus 5.5 ends the first call `content_filtered`; pydantic-ai's \"Please return text\" retry is filtered too (the CI-logged request). Single-shot as shipped 8/8 filtered, agentic 6/8; removing the system prompt 0/8; adding a concrete criterion + evidence with every other word kept 0/10 each. It is not the reasoning-in-schema refusal on epic pompous-vitriolic-macaw (text mode, no schema, no reasoning requested).\n\nProduction exposure, measured (not inferred): the real `completion-verifier` prompt (`src/rebar/llm/reviewers/completion_verifier.md`, rendered by `prompts.resolve_prompt_cached`) with a ticket context holding an AC but no evidence: Opus 5.5 0/10, Sonnet 5.5 0/10; with neither AC nor evidence: 0/10, 0/10. The empty-evidence production path is therefore not filtered at these sample sizes, and the bare system prompt above exists only in the test (`git grep -nF 'single structured verdict' -- src` returns nothing). No runtime change is in scope.\n\n## Approach\nGive the harness a verifier request with something to verify, matching what a production verifier receives. Move the system prompt and both user prompts into the pure helper `tests/external/_structured_matrix.py` (it already owns `DIRECTIVE_VARIANTS`, line 29) as `SYSTEM_PROMPT`, `AGENTIC_TRANSCRIPT_PROMPT`, `SINGLE_SHOT_PROMPT`, `PROMPTS`, so the offline oracle `tests/unit/test_structured_matrix_scorer.py` pins the whole request. Shipped text (exactly what was measured):\n- shared block: `Ticket 7c41-0d2e-9a85-b613 has one acceptance criterion: \"`add(a, b)` returns the sum of its arguments.\" Evidence: `tests/test_add.py::test_add_returns_sum` passed (1 passed in 0.01s), and `src/calc.py` defines `def add(a, b): return a + b`.`\n- agentic: the existing role line, the shared block, the existing quoted `{\"relation\": \"depends_on\", \"target_id\": \"f2f3-9cb1-335b-4e31\"}` record, then the verdict request.\n- single-shot: the shared block, then the verdict request.\n- both requests read: a JSON object with `verdict` (PASS or FAIL), a `findings` array (empty when every criterion is met), and a `summary` string.\nThe \"empty when met\" clause is needed: without it Opus 5.5 returned per-criterion findings lacking `detail`, which fail `CompletionVerdict` validation (0/20 parsed); with it 10/10 per variant parsed.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/external/_structured_matrix.py`: add the four constants.\n- `tests/external/test_structured_output_matrix.py`: use them; delete the old prompt constants.\n- `tests/unit/test_structured_matrix_scorer.py`: pin the prompt shape.\n\n## Testing\n- Unit, against string literals written in the test (not the module constants): both prompts contain the criterion sentence and the `test_add_returns_sum` evidence; labels are `agentic_transcript`, `single_shot`; `SYSTEM_PROMPT` equals the measured literal.\n- Unit, edge: the single-shot control contains no `{`; the agentic prompt contains exactly one JSON object, placed before \"emit your FINAL\", and its `target_id` differs from the verified ticket id.\n- Live, before push (recorded in a ticket comment): direct converse, 50 calls per (variant, prompt) cell, pass = 0 filtered; through the rebar runner, 5 per cell, pass = 0 filtered and every reply parses.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [x] Root cause identified: the filtered cell and the request feature that triggers the filter, reproduced against Bedrock Opus 5.5; evidence recorded in a ticket comment.\n- [x] Fix lands through Gerrit with LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1; no new config key, env var or feature flag.\n- [x] [non-codebase] A `Live External Integration` run on main after the fix (a manual `workflow_dispatch` run counts) shows `external LLM (live bedrock)` concluding success; run id recorded on this ticket.\n  provenance: environment=GitHub Actions Live External Integration workflow on navapbc/rebar main; principal=the CI Bedrock OIDC role (repository variable AWS_BEDROCK_CI_ROLE_ARN); privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — the criterion is about that exact workflow job, so its own run conclusion is the evidence.\n- [x] `env -u JIRA_URL -u JIRA_USER -u JIRA_API_TOKEN .venv/bin/pytest tests/unit/test_structured_matrix_scorer.py` passes, including the new prompt-shape tests.\n- [x] `make verify` exits 0 on the pushed commit.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/external/_structured_matrix.py","reason":"own the evidence-bearing matrix prompts"},{"path":"tests/external/test_structured_output_matrix.py","reason":"use sm.PROMPTS instead of verdict-without-evidence prompts"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_structured_matrix_scorer.py","reason":"pin prompt shape offline"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","3062-d19f-9c00-4c81"],["relates_to","4245-9f90-9d32-44c0"],["relates_to","7341-7f22-b13a-442c"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"da609245-0029-40ea-b472-029358fd9b3a","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"95bd-beb1-8c3f-465f","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Live bedrock CI arm: Opus 5.5 returns content_filtered on test_structured_output_matrix after the 5.5 model upgrade","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["8515be0d-b3e4-4c32-968d-e064b49d60d4","6f7be16d-a94d-401f-9ef3-92b1e8daa57c","cfa98984-4526-4a67-9896-b4133ba9fd43","a9f42e20-2d8b-4a5f-bca6-64cbdc9be651","b629980e-ff7c-46da-b6af-9bd9257ca950","7c7018cf-e4d8-4779-89dc-9a9dcdbe8efd","c9abf1a9-b8af-4e8c-96e6-669a4a320fb1","fe722ee4-788e-4897-801b-34f05fa98e9c","58f1cc36-cf4e-427e-b7e4-849ea3655a32","139aef8e-f1ae-4da4-9f86-9ee00931b5fd","035ff462-2e35-495e-a850-719e638a3d4c","da609245-0029-40ea-b472-029358fd9b3a","9fcab1c8-1698-468c-aa34-5373c57004ef","17c0a411-a546-48fe-879a-39331e407495","60691fb2-6971-4ff7-bf26-a7d6a7d35012"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794370618429953105,"uuid":"f92f37f7-85d5-407e-a197-a7647abecf54"}